OL,3,GNEWSACharity Santa ride gears up for   
OL,4,Aits 20th year                          
OL,6,FA charity motorcycle Santa ride is     
OL,7,Fgearing up for its 20th year, with 160 
OL,8,Friders aiming to delight onlookers with
OL,9,Ftheir costumes, music and the roaring  
OL,10,Fof engines.                            
OL,12,FThe Boundary 500 Motorcycle Santa ride 
OL,13,Fwill follow its 22mile (35km) route    
OL,14,Ffrom Thornaby to Kirkleatham Hall near 
OL,15,FRedcar on Saturday.                    
OL,17,FFounder Brian Laverick, 75, said they  
OL,18,Fwere hoping to raise the #23,000 needed
OL,19,Fto reach #500,000 in total donations   
OL,20,Ffor Middlesbrough-based Zoe's Place,   
OL,21,Fadding the event meant "so much to so  
OL,22,Fmany people".                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
