OL,3,GNEWSACharity Santa ride gears up for   
OL,4,Aits 20th year                          
OL,6,FNisha Mayu, 43, who lives in           
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough and has watched with her 
OL,8,Ffamily from the same corner since 2016,
OL,9,Fsaid her three children enjoyed waving 
OL,10,Fat and high-fiving the riders.         
